WEBVTT

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:43.310
This area will be perfect for Lee's next flick.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:47.730
You better make this one a hit.

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:52.110
The future of Hong Kong's movies is resting on this film.

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:52.780
Of course.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:58.530
We finally start shooting tomorrow.

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:05.580
Lee, run!

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:06.540
Hurry!

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:08.420
Step on it!

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.420
Ku!

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:12.210
Ku!

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:20.970
You will make... a great movie...

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.620
My son...

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:47.500
He's another in the line of several famous Asian actors and their big-shot producers to be killed recently.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:52.500
There are people with a lot of pull who want to put a stop to this picture.

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:55.510
It's hopeless.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.840
We can't shoot on location under these conditions.

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:03.100
They'll just come and attack us again.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:07.100
This means we can't make this movie.

00:02:08.650 --> 00:02:09.520
We got no choice but to give-

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:11.060
What are you saying, Lee?

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.150
I will not give up!

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:16.110
I'll do whatever it takes to protect you and this film to the end!

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:19.320
Right now I've called in the cavalry.

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:22.120
I think I know what's on your minds.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:31.250
You really came, Gol- I mean, Mr. Duke Togo.

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:34.960
Sorry, but I will not be his bodyguard.

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:41.760
Your job is to eliminate those who are out to kill Lee, and the people directing them!

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.810
Do you know who they are?

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:46.520
Oh... not yet.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:49.770
But we're making full use of our networks!

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:53.270
We will try to figure out immediately who those people really are!

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:57.860
I just lost my beloved son today.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:01.280
But as long as I can secure the future of Hong Kong films...

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:05.490
...I would give up the lives of my entire family!

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.290
There's just one condition.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:19.720
Then you'll take the job if we meet it?

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:22.180
I need to be alone with my client.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:32.900
I walk unsteadily on paths to nowhere

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:37.020
wondering what I should do right now.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:43.490
I play the song you like on the car stereo

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:48.040
with the volume up and my feelings crystallized

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:53.670
driving on streets with no crossroads or signals

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:59.090
with a speed that will catch up with you.

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:03.550
So faraway - let's run!

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:09.850
And let's not bother with the breaks - full throttle.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:14.150
Oh someday - one of these days

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:19.230
You'll be at my place where nobody can find you.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:25.320
Whenever you suffer a breakdown one can't see

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:30.910
depend on me for your repairs.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:35.290
So faraway - let's run!

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:41.510
We'll reset and start again - even at our limit.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:45.800
Oh someday - one of these days

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:51.850
If I'm with you we'll find our dream.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:14.830
End of the Century Hollywood

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:11.490
Shit!

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:11.870
Hey!

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:13.500
Hey!

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:13.750
Dammit...

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:14.960
C'mon!

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.750
So how's Lee doing?

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:25.260
He's been at ease and at peak form since Golgo took the job.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:28.850
Still...

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:30.300
Where is he?

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:31.850
Not here, huh?

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:34.390
If they're trying to kill him now, he'd be as good as dead.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:36.600
Well I believe in him.

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:39.650
I'm sure he's keeping a close eye on things from somewhere.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:10.720
Hey...

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:11.140
What happened?

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:13.430
He... He's bleeding!

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:13.930
Whoa!

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:16.560
Hey... this knife is real!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:17.640
What the...?

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:21.400
So that means that guy was trying to kill me?

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.030
He's dead!

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.360
Hey, somebody...

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.360
It's him.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.240
He saved him.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:40.540
This is a real slip-up for you DIA types.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.630
Lee's still alive and breathing.

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:48.630
If he's able to complete his film, it'll bankrupt our company.

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.380
We know.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:54.720
Loi's production will definitely be a blockbuster.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:07:00.850
The popularity of Hong Kong movies will erode our own film industry.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:05.070
But even at that, Hollywood's sense of urgency is lacking.

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:07.070
And that's where our problem lies.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:11.660
Those Hollywood moguls aren't getting enraged.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:15.660
Instead they are thoughtlessly applauding Lee's films.

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:18.540
So utterly pathetic.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:29.170
The film industry has achieved its essential and strategic role in spreading our nation's values across the entire globe.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:36.140
That encroachment will lead to the fading of our nation's image, and with it our influence.

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:39.930
Isn't that alone a national crisis?

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:43.350
Don't worry, we're still going after him.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:46.650
All right, I'll trust you on this one.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.150
However...

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:56.410
I just got a report this morning stating that Loi now appears to have Golgo 13 on his side.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:58.700
What? Golgo 13?

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:03.290
Having Golgo as an enemy presents us with a real curveball.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:11.800
Thanks to you, I haven't had any attacks for a while.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:12.970
Does this mean they've given up?

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:16.300
Pros don't give up that easily.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:22.480
They must be making considerable
preparations knowing that I'm around.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:30.150
Construction?

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:47.040
Why's that guy driving so damn slow?

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:48.590
What is he-?

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:51.510
Bulletproof glass!

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:54.340
Don't stop. Drive and push him out the way.

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:55.260
R-Right!

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:06.650
It's bulletproof!

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:21.870
All right!

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:23.080
Stop the car.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:26.370
Shit...

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:48.190
<i>9mm MP5SD3s?</i>

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.440
You still don't know who your enemies are?

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:58.780
Forgive us. We're trying our best to investigate.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:03.330
Chinese businessmen keep a secret building in the Bronx, correct?

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:04.290
Uh, yes.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:08.080
Let's go. It'll be easier to protect him there than in a hotel.

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:17.340
Every glass window in this building is bulletproof.

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:22.350
Plus we've put cameras in each room
which allows us to monitor them from here.

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:27.850
We also have soldiers stationed here who are trained militarily.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.600
These men are here to help you

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:32.150
Don't need them.

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:35.440
Too many people moving around will just impede me.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.110
"Impede"?

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:43.580
You got it. They'll all be withdrawn.

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:45.330
You too. Now.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.950
Right now?

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:47.870
That's right.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.620
They'll be coming tonight.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.790
T-Tonight?

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:01.800
What are you doing?

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:04.260
Increasing the elevator speeds.

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:06.810
Speed?

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:13.230
This face-off depends on how fast I can repel enemy attacks.

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.750
The forced-entry team is set to go.

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.000
Good!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.460
They got a rank amateur as a bodyguard, even if it's Golgo.

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:35.250
This is ours to win!

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:35.840
Sir!

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:42.800
The lights!

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:44.220
It's fine.

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:46.810
Our in-house generator will soon kick in.

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:01.820
I... It's them!

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:05.030
You two stay here.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:07.160
I'll take care of them.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.050
The sharpshooting team are good to go.

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:31.600
The forced-entry team is ready when you are.

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:37.230
Okay... ten seconds until penetration.

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:41.360
All personnel must carry out their assigned duties.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:45.240
Begin penetration!

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:51.790
What happened?

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:57.250
It's him! Golgo's right on top of us!

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:59.170
Sharpshooters, where's your cover?

00:12:57.670 --> 00:12:59.170
Fire! Fire!

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:01.800
Hey! Sharpshooters! Answer me!

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:06.010
The Dragon... use it to blast the entry!

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:09.760
Move in!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:16.690
Now then, I'll also be going in there
to take care of Golgo and the others.

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.650
Chief Alan, you stay here.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.690
I promise you'll be safe in here, so remain at ease.

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.200
They've made it in!

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.530
There are four at the first-floor entrance!

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:28.490
Copy.

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:44.800
Empty?

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:46.970
Search it!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:47.630
Ten-four.

00:13:58.770 --> 00:13:59.520
There's no one...

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:11.490
What happened?

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.160
Report your status!

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:16.870
Dammit!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:20.210
Alpha Five! Alpha Five! Begin penetration!

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:27.970
They're now coming from the roof!

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:32.930
They're throwing ropes down the wall in order to get to the eighth floor where we're located!

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:44.530
Shit! It's bulletproof!

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:56.450
He's at the top!

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:58.410
Attack starting from the top floor!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:01.250
All remaining personnel get in there!

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.880
Shoot Golgo to death!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.380
They're coming in from the roof!

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:10.340
And with more than double the number!

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:12.510
Huh?

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:13.890
They're also coming from the first floor!

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:15.560
That's a whole lot!

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:20.140
Could even Golgo deal with those numbers?

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:21.940
Check every room!

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:29.820
302 - clear!

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:34.200
411...

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:35.910
...clear!

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.920
505 - clear!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:44.040
They're now at the floor above us!

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:46.340
It's hopeless, they'll soon be here!

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.350
<i>The PTRS.</i>

00:15:57.350 --> 00:16:03.980
<i>But this one is specially made to fire
tungsten alloy flechettes with sabots.</i>

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:10.570
<i>It can pierce a 50mm iron plate like an arrow from 1,000 meters away.</i>

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:12.570
<i>You like?</i>

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:14.820
907 - clear!

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.240
They're not on this floor!

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:19.620
All right, let's move down to the next floor!

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:23.580
It's only a matter of time before we find those guys.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:26.210
What the hell?!

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.710
It's... It's a bullet!

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:31.130
A bullet penetrated through from one floor below-

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:35.090
Dammit.... Shoot! Shoot!

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:37.970
I-It's no use!

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:40.520
Our bullets aren't going though the floor!

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:43.600
Where do I shoot next?

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:46.150
One o'clock from where you are!

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:49.530
Next?

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:51.070
Nine o'clock!

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:52.990
God damn...

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.990
He'll wipe us out at this rate!

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:59.030
He knows exactly what type of guns we're carrying.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:07.210
All right!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:10.750
The unit from the top is keeping him busy! Now move!

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.220
Godammit...

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:21.350
I'm not gonna lie here dying without a fight.

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:24.020
I'm taking you with me!

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.040
Sucks to be you!

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:49.750
We've won this match!

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:06.940
Loi?

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:09.190
Hmph!

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:11.650
Useless bullshit.

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:17.900
Christ, you're still alive?

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:19.780
Fire dammit!

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.920
<i>One round left.</i>

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.000
<i>And one grenade.</i>

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:44.220
Don't panic!

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:46.770
It's just halogen gas used for fires!

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.310
It has no effect on the human body!

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:04.830
Loi?

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:06.540
Loi!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.830
What the hell are you trying to do?

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:11.330
Grab hold of something when I shoot.

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.380
Huh?

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:13.670
Do as I say!

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:21.260
Get a hold of yourselves!

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:24.010
The gas only increases the atmospheric pressure!

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:27.020
And you call yourselves DIA soldiers?

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:28.480
<i>So they are DIA?</i>

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:35.110
Hang on, Loi!

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:36.020
Grab something!

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:12.020
What the hell just...?

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:16.020
The halogen gas filled an airtight room.

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:19.400
The air pressure in this room exceeded the outside air pressure by several folds.

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:25.370
Once he blew out the glass window, the difference in air pressures sucked everything out of this room.

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:29.540
Golgo 13 certainly thinks on a whole different level...

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:35.500
Loi, get yourself together!

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:41.300
There's no need to mourn.

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:45.050
Even if those guys hadn't killed me...

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:50.180
...I'd still lose my life come morning once he completed his job.

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:51.350
What?

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:57.480
He demanded to take my life once his work was finished.

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:05.490
I will know all his tactical secrets if I
accompany him throughout this thing.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:10.490
So I went along with that condition.

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:12.330
Loi...

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:14.460
Why?

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:17.790
Golgo 13...

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:20.000
...thank you.

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.460
I am grateful.

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:23.800
I know who's behind it all.

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:26.970
I will finish up my assignment.

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:29.550
Oh... thank you!

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:31.970
It was fun.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:39.360
No offense, Lee, but this was the
biggest thrill I had in my whole life.

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:45.070
Loi...

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:46.490
Loi!

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:48.870
Loi!

00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:57.170
Massacred.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:01.210
What is this?

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:04.340
Those were the DIA's elite units!

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:47.220
I  was worried with no one to talk to.

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:50.260
I was brooding and standing still

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:52.430
without moving a muscle.

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:55.600
I wonder when that was?

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:57.310
I'm sure

00:22:57.310 --> 00:23:00.480
you agonized over how

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:05.730
people will hurt themselves and other people

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:08.990
and fail to realize it.

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:10.110
When

00:23:10.110 --> 00:23:13.530
the same days keep repeating themselves

00:23:13.530 --> 00:23:15.790
you never change.

00:23:16.490 --> 00:23:18.040
Since you're here for me

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:22.330
I will accept the way that I am.

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:26.590
I will never leave you alone

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:29.930
I will softly touch your trembling heart.

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:36.810
I realized that I'm not the only one who's alone.

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:39.980
We're enveloped in the gentle sun beams.

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:43.310
The long winter is finally over.

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:49.950
The parts of us that were lonely will surely get stronger.

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:07.380
Danielle, the mayor's wife, turned pale
once she witnessed Golgo at the hotel bar.

00:24:08.050 --> 00:24:11.010
She then makes a certain decision under panic.

00:24:11.590 --> 00:24:14.760
Did something happen between her and Golgo in the past?

00:24:15.800 --> 00:24:19.180
The intertwined expectations eventually invites tragedy.

00:24:18.430 --> 00:24:24.770
The Unceasing Night

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:23.810
Next time on Golgo 13: The Unceasing Night.

00:24:23.810 --> 00:24:27.610
Don't stand behind him, if you value your life.
